cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "PURSUE UAP Documents Dataset: A structured catalog of declassified U.S. government UAP records"
abstract: >-
  A structured catalog of every U.S. government UAP record released under the
  PURSUE initiative (Presidential Unsealing and Reporting System for UAP
  Encounters), covering all public tranches from May 8, 2026 onward: 323
  records, 1947-2026, 11 source agencies, 6 releases. Each row carries the
  releasing agency, document/event year, release tranche, file-package
  composition, location as named in the record, official source URL, and a set
  of source-status labels describing what kind of evidence the record is.
type: dataset
